# fm84 po slovensky.
#
# Each msgid is the English as the code has it, and the msgstr under it what
# is shown in its place. A sentence with a count in it has a msgstr for each
# form the count takes: [one] for 1, [few] for 2, 3 and 4, [other] for the
# rest, 21 too. A msgctxt sets one use of a word apart from the same word
# elsewhere. {name} is a place the program fills, kept as it is. The letters
# to press - Y, N, A and the like - stay as they are, and so do the names of
# the keys. Names are quoted „thus“.

